    'svc.w.p':'Corporate websites, portals and intranets built by hand, no templates. Fast, polished and made to convert.',
    'svc.w.l':'<li>Business websites and e-commerce</li><li>Portals and intranets</li><li>Also the personal site of an athlete or an actor</li>',
