    'sov.g.emp':'Your company','sov.g.ia':'Own AI','sov.g.nube':'US cloud','sov.g.ro':'read only','sov.g.iso':'isolated','sov.g.ro':'read only','sov.g.iso':'isolated',
    'sov.s1.t':'What you already have','sov.s1.p':'Your databases and your documents. They live in your company and that is where they will stay.',
    'sov.s2.t':'The AI moves in','sov.s2.p':'We install it inside: on your servers or on ours, with our own AI. Never in an American cloud.',
    'sov.s3.t':'The door stays shut','sov.s3.p':'A private connection just for you, data isolated and read only. Nothing crosses outside. And this is not a slogan: you can audit it.',
    'sov.s4.t':'You ask, it answers','sov.s4.p':'You talk to it in your own words and it answers with your data. And if you need it, we train it on purpose to be an expert in your field.',
    'icp.label':'Who it is for',
    'icp.h2':'Is one of these questions yours?',
    'icp.sub':'We work with companies that keep valuable things. Each one arrives with its own question.',
