    'icp.c1.b':'Law and advisory firms','icp.c1.q':'&#8220;Would you upload a case file to an American AI?&#8221;','icp.c1.p':'All your case law and files, searchable in seconds without leaving the firm.',
    'icp.c2.b':'Insurance brokers and wealth managers','icp.c2.q':'&#8220;Would you put your clients\' data in someone else\'s cloud?&#8221;','icp.c2.p':'Check policies, contracts and portfolios with the confidentiality the rules demand.',
    'icp.c3.b':'Engineering firms and manufacturers','icp.c3.q':'&#8220;Your technical knowledge, in whose hands?&#8221;','icp.c3.p':'Drawings, procedures and quality docs found in an instant. Your intellectual property stays home.',
    'icp.d.b':'The chatbot · For almost anyone',
    'icp.d.t':'What if your problem is not getting to everything?',
    'icp.d.p':'The support chatbot works for almost any business that deals with people: online stores, clinics, distributors, real estate, academies, workshops. If you answer the same questions every day, it is for you.',
    'icp.d.cta':'Tell us your case <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>',
    'case.label':'Real projects',
    'case.h2':'This is how it starts with us.',
    'case.sub':'Entry projects already running: websites and chatbots. That is how trust for the big one is built. No names for confidentiality: we will show them to you on a call.',
    'case.c1.tag':'Premium web · Delivered',
    'case.c1.t':'Official website of a professional footballer',
