    'case.c2.t':'WhatsApp bookings for a hair salon',
    'case.c2.p':'A chatbot that books, changes and cancels appointments 24/7 and manages the waiting list. Zero missed calls, nobody tied to the phone.',
    'case.c2.m':'WhatsApp · 24/7 bookings · Waiting list',
