    'why.label':'Why fluentIA',
    'why.h2':'The first AI company<br>made in Albacete.',
    'why.sub':'fluentIA was born in 2026 with one idea: that artificial intelligence shouldn\'t belong only to the big consultancies. A local business, an accountancy firm or a factory in the region should be able to have it on their side.',
    'why.s1':'Lines of work','why.s2':'Bespoke','why.s3':'Founded',
    'why.v1.t':'Your data rules','why.v1.p':'On your servers or on ours, isolated and read only. Sovereignty is not a slogan: it can be audited.',
    'why.v2.t':'Process before technology','why.v2.p':'BPMN 2.0, Six Sigma and a senior Appian certification. We do not just build a chatbot: we model the process behind it.',
    'why.v3.t':'Artisan closeness','why.v3.p':'AI made by hand in Albacete, with an identifiable person who picks up the phone. Closeness is part of the product.',
    'proc.after':'And after delivery: <strong>support, performance reports and continuous improvement</strong>.',
    'faq.label':'FAQ','faq.h2':'Frequently asked questions.',
    'faq.q1':'How much does it cost?','faq.a1':'Every project is priced individually, based on its scope: you get a fixed, written quote before we start — no surprises. Tell us your case and we\'ll prepare a proposal, no strings attached.',
    'faq.q2':'How long does a project take?','faq.a2':'Diagnosis and proposal take a few days. First results usually arrive within one or two weeks depending on scope.',
    'faq.q3':'What happens to my data?','faq.a3':'Your AI is private: it works solely with your information, which is never shared or used to train third-party models. We work under GDPR and sign a data-processing agreement where applicable.',
    'faq.q4':'What if I\'m not sure what I need?','faq.a4':'That\'s the usual case. We run a free diagnosis: we look at your day-to-day, spot what steals the most hours and propose where to start.',
    'faq.q5':'Do you only work in Albacete?','faq.a5':'We\'re based in Albacete and work across Castilla-La Mancha and the rest of Spain, remotely or on site depending on the project.',
    'faq.q6':'What happens after delivery?','faq.a6':'We don\'t disappear: warranty on what we deliver, close support, performance reports and continuous improvement. You always talk to the people who built your system.',
    'faq.q7':'Does it work with my SharePoint and my SQL?','faq.a7':'Yes, that is our favourite case. We connect the AI to your SQL databases, your SharePoint and your document folders, and you ask it in plain language. If you use another document system, we will look at it: there is almost always a way.',
    'faq.q8':'Can I run the AI on my own servers?','faq.a8':'Yes. We install it in your house, with our own AI running on your hardware, or on our servers with a private connection just for you. It never goes through American clouds.',
    'faq.q9':'What is this CLOUD Act thing?','faq.a9':'A United States law that lets its authorities request data from American providers, wherever their servers are. If your data is sensitive, that is a strong reason not to upload it to those platforms. Our answer: it never leaves your perimeter.',
    'founder.role':'Founder of fluentIA',
    'founder.p1':'Physicist by training and holder of a Master\'s in Strategic Process Management. My career has always revolved around the same idea: making processes work better.',
    'founder.p2':'At <strong>Capgemini</strong> and other major consultancies I worked in <strong>hyperautomation</strong> and BPM on large banking projects, automating critical workflows end to end. <strong>Senior Appian certification</strong>, <strong>BPMN 2.0</strong> and <strong>Six Sigma</strong>: process first, then technology.',
    'founder.p3':'That\'s where I saw the problem: this power was only within reach of large corporations. fluentIA exists to change that, so any company, <strong>whatever its size</strong>, can access AI and automation to boost its business.',
    'founder.linkedin':'Connect on LinkedIn','founder.blog':'My BPM and AI articles',
    'privacy.link':'privacy policy',
    'con.consent.pre':'I have read and accept the ',
    'hf.consent.pre':'I want to be notified at launch and I have read the ',
    'hf.consent2':'I also want to receive other commercial communications from fluentIA (optional).',
