    'prob.p1':'Your company holds valuable things: case files, policies, drawings, contracts, procedures. AI could put them to great use, but uploading them to a US provider is not an option. GDPR, your clients\' confidentiality and the CLOUD Act get in the way.',
    'prob.p2':'We solve it the other way round: the AI comes to your data. <em>Your data never goes to the AI.</em>',
